# Build context for the parent-console image (server/Dockerfile builds from the repo
# root because the console imports the pairing-QR codec from tools/pairing/).
# Allowlist: ship nothing but those two trees.
*
!server/
!tools/pairing/

# …and never the runtime/secret bits inside them.
server/moxie.db
server/moxie.db-*
**/.env
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
